  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.7 - DETR detectors: D-FINE and RT-DETR / RT-DETRv2 run and match onnxruntime (three engine bugs fixed), DetrDetectionPipeline with Pillow-exact preprocessing. Graph capture records only its own async flow (needs SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.17); CUDA graph capture of large graphs no longer crashes; Split / Concat one dispatch per output. ComfyUI deep shrink area / bislerp and attention-multiply (SdUNet / SdTextEncoder.ScaleAsync). Col2Im and DeformConv corrected. Chrome WebGPU LLM decode at long prompts +7%. See CHANGELOG.md.",
